# Check every text file out with LF, on Windows too. The tests lift functions
# out of src/renderer.js by matching "\n}\n", the MCP server reads SKILL.md
# frontmatter line by line, and the shell scripts must stay LF to run at all;
# a CRLF checkout (git's default on Windows) breaks all three.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.icns binary
*.ico  binary
*.dmg  binary
*.zip  binary
*.xlsx binary
*.transmission binary
*.pdf  binary
